{"title": "Moonshae Zinfandel", "pageid": 58157, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Moonshae_Zinfandel", "categories": ["Drinks"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Moonshae Zinfandel</b> is a variety of red wine. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Multiple vintages can be found at the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a>, likely collected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/38px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/50px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a>. A plaque in her <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall#Nine-Fingers'_Office\" title=\"Guildhall\">office</a> reads <i>Someone's Vintage Moonshae Zinfandel Collection. But it looks like a lot of bottles have gone missing.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vintages\">Vintages</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonshae_Zinfandel_1461\